## Summary of Progress So Far

We have successfully:
1. Ensured origin builds with go 1.24.0
2. Added origin import to OTP with local replace directive  
3. Copied all OTP util code to origin's compat_otp package
4. Extended origin's CLI with missing OTP methods via util_otp.go
5. Resolved all circular dependencies by copying needed packages
6. Added all missing cloud SDK dependencies
7. Fixed the otelgrpc build issue with a replace directive
8. Created two checkpoint branches: compat_otp_5 and compat_otp_8

Origin now has a complete copy of OTP's util functionality and builds successfully.
The next steps (9-13) will focus on eliminating duplicate functions and migrating OTP 
to use origin's util package instead of its internal one. 